\title{copulagps: Copula-Based Generalized Propensity Scores for Multivariate Continuous Treatments}
\description{
Estimates generalized propensity scores (GPS) for multivariate continuous treatments using copula models, with support for limit-of-detection (LOD) censoring via Tobit-MLE and iterative copula imputation. Provides covariate balance assessment; GPS-weighted average treatment effect (ATE) and marginal structural odds ratio (OR) estimation with delta-method standard errors; dose-response function (DRF) estimation and visualisation over a treatment grid; convex hull and Mahalanobis overlap trimming; multiple augmentation chains with Rubin's rules variance combination; three censoring-method strategies for the outcome model (IFAM, uncensored-only, substitution); and a user-extensible API for applying custom outcome models to augmented data.
